   "text": "Ashland University (Postgraduate) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nAshland University (Postgraduate)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nFounded in 1878 as Ashland College, the name of the institution was changed to Ashland University in 1989 to reflect the many diverse undergraduate, graduate and professional programs offered.\nAshland continues to have a rich tradition as a private, comprehensive institution preparing students for exciting professions and careers. The university consists of four academic colleges - the College of Arts & Sciences, Dauch College of Business & Economics, Schar College of Education and Schar College of Nursing and Health Sciences - as well as Ashland Theological Seminary.\nAshland University places great emphasis on the importance of each individual. The phrase “Accent on the Individual” has been an AU core value for many years and characterizes well the nature and content of the campus environment. It means that our concern for the student extends beyond ensuring a quality education in the classroom and laboratory to include a commitment to provide a stimulating and supportive environment in every respect. These ideas must be evidenced daily in the classroom, residence halls, each teaching site, on the playing fields and in our interaction with others.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 10:09\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n26/03/2026 10:09\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\nCountry\nUnited States\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$13,900.00\nMin: US$6,950.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n2%\n130 of 6,500 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1878\nCampus(es)\nOhio\nCountry\nUnited States\nExcluded Countries\nChina\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n Yes\nContract Start Date\n08/11/2023\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.ashland.edu/residence-life\nhttps://www.ashland.edu/residence-halls-comparison\nScholarship Offered\n-Merit Scholarship up to $14,000 with no additional application (Automatically provided based on GPA)\n-Honors Program Scholarship up to $1,500\n-Dean´s Scholarships up to $1,500\n-Scholarships can be combined for a total of around 17,000 USD.\nhttps://www.ashland.edu/ashland-university-scholarships-grants\nhttps://www.ashland.edu/international-student-tuition-fees\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odDArAnF38g\nInternship Details\nhttps://www.ashland.edu/employer-resources\nhttps://www.ashland.edu/internshipwork-experience-program\nAdditional Information\n-",
